Title: MARY HAD A LITTLE LAMB

FADE IN:

EXT. COUNTRY LANE - DAY

MARY, a young girl with brown braids, a blue pinafore, white apron, and straw bonnet, walks with her lamb.

MARY
Come along.

INT. SCHOOLHOUSE - DAY

The TEACHER, a middle-aged woman in a dark gray dress, stands at the front. ELI and CLARA watch.

ELI
Why does he follow her?

CLARA
What makes the lamb love Mary so?

TEACHER
Oh, Mary loves the lamb, you know.

FADE OUT.
